# Title: imperative, 50 chars max — what changed
# e.g. "Remap Caps Lock to Escape on DVORAK layer"


# Why: one sentence on the motivation (optional but preferred)
# e.g. "Caps Lock is unused and Escape is more ergonomic from home row"


# --- Atomic commit checklist ---
# [ ] One logical change per commit
# [ ] Binding count verified (36 per layer)
# [ ] Layer referenced by #define name, not raw number
